<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Hardened-runtime entitlements for the frozen Python core (Contents/Resources/sidecar),
  applied only to its executable by build/sign-sidecar.js. Deliberately empty (SEC-12,
  R2-08): build/sign-sidecar.js re-signs every Mach-O in the PyInstaller bundle with the
  same identity (one Team ID), so library validation passes without
  disable-library-validation, and the sidecar (cryptography, cffi, ctypes) runs under the
  hardened runtime without allow-unsigned-executable-memory. Both were removed after a
  signed build passed scripts/smoke-sidecar.py without them. If a future dependency needs
  one back, add it here and say why.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
  <dict/>
</plist>
